{
  "name": "Recorta · Formularios web y Google Ads → CRM",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Recorta · Formularios → CRM\nURL: `https://TU-N8N/webhook/recorta-formularios` (POST, JSON).\n- **Google Ads**: formulario de clientes potenciales → Integración de webhook, con esta URL y la clave `FORM_KEY`.\n- **Web u otra herramienta**: manda los campos (nombre, telefono, email, provincia, acepto, las preguntas de la línea) y `clave`.\n- `linea` o `interes` eligen la línea; si no viene, va a **luz**.\n\nEl lead entra en Leads de la app con su prioridad y te avisa el flujo 04.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "55cf50f3-efbf-4a18-a6b4-6190cd9f16ce",
      "name": "Nota cb86",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "recorta-formularios",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a8d7a1e-493c-4ba6-9a01-2b769d01876c",
      "name": "Formulario recibido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "76cbdb45-c079-44cb-b46e-83ecc1f42edd"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Acepta el formato de Google Ads (user_column_data + google_key), Meta (field_data) o un JSON plano.\n// Clave: google_key, \"clave\" en el cuerpo, ?clave= o la cabecera x-form-key (FORM_KEY del Config).\nconst req = $input.first().json;\nconst b = req.body ?? {};\nconst google = Array.isArray(b.user_column_data);\nconst clave = google ? b.google_key : (b.clave ?? req.query?.clave ?? req.headers?.['x-form-key']);\nif (!$('Config').first().json.FORM_KEY || clave !== $('Config').first().json.FORM_KEY) return [{ json: { valido: false, motivo: 'clave incorrecta' } }];\nconst lead = {};\nif (google) {\n  const nombres = { FULL_NAME: 'nombre', FIRST_NAME: 'first_name', LAST_NAME: 'last_name', PHONE_NUMBER: 'telefono', EMAIL: 'email', POSTAL_CODE: 'codigo_postal', CITY: 'ciudad', REGION: 'provincia' };\n  for (const c of b.user_column_data) lead[nombres[c.column_id] || c.column_name || c.column_id] = c.string_value;\n  lead.canal = 'google';\n  lead.campana = b.campaign_id ? 'Google Ads ' + b.campaign_id : 'google-ads';\n  lead.acepto = 'si'; // el formulario de Google ya incluye la política de privacidad del anunciante\n} else {\n  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(b)) if (k !== 'clave' && (v === null || typeof v !== 'object')) lead[k] = v;\n  if (b.answers && typeof b.answers === 'object') Object.assign(lead, b.answers);\n  if (Array.isArray(b.field_data)) for (const f of b.field_data) lead[f.name] = Array.isArray(f.values) ? f.values.join(', ') : f.values;\n  lead.canal = lead.canal ?? b.source ?? 'web';\n}\nlead.linea = lead.linea ?? lead.interes ?? $('Config').first().json.LINEA;\nreturn [{ json: { valido: true, lead } }];"
      },
      "id": "02cfbba2-b087-446e-8aed-6dcbb64912ed",
      "name": "Preparar lead",
